            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I must apologize. I'm Swan - the leader of the Hoods. We just aren't very good at this robbery business. We're thieves - but not the bad kind.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_FennecFox_Boss_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Swan_MIR_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1381232,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "We used to work the Bazaar. When a corrupt merchant swindled an innocent citizen, we'd pick his pocket and return the gold, keeping a small cut.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_FennecFox_Boss_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Swan_MIR_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1381232,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But the King of Thieves shut us down, under pressure from the other gangs, of course. Now those gangs have the run of the entire city.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_FennecFox_Boss_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Swan_MIR_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1381232,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Not only that, but after letting the city go down the drainpipe, the King of Thieves just skipped town, abandoning Aggrobah to gang control.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_FennecFox_Boss_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Swan_MIR_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1381232,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
